g was booked or charged. I also didn't try again or book the flight and hotel separately, since that would get around the approval rule.\n\n**Next step:** please check with the manager whether they meant to approve. If they did, I can send the same booking again. It uses the same idempotency key, so if it ends up submitted more than once, it will still only be booked once.", "type": "text"}]}]}